OL,3,GNEWSAYork man, 19, shot and injured in
OL,4,AKrakow attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old British man is in a
OL,7,Fstable condition after being shot by a
OL,8,Fgunman in Krakow, Poland.
OL,10,FHarry Marchant, from York, suffered a
OL,11,Fgunshot wound in the attack on
OL,12,FSaturday, which began shortly before
OL,13,F15:00 local time (14:00 GMT) in
OL,14,FKrakow's busy Main Market Square.
OL,16,FThe 24-year-old attacker, who died in
OL,17,Fhospital on Monday, fatally shot four
OL,18,FPolish citizens, a British national and
OL,19,Fan Austrian woman, while a further 15
OL,20,Fpeople, including two police officers,
OL,21,Fwere injured.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
